    "lawCode": "Amd §253-d, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "Tax Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S3334\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to amend the tax law, in relation to extending the expiration\nof the mortgage recording tax imposed by the city of Yonkers\n\n\n PURPOSE :\n\nThis bill extends for two years the mortgage recording tax in the city\nof Yonkers until the year 2011.\n\n SUMMARY OF PROVISIONS :\n\nThis bill amends subdivision 1 of section 253-d of the tax law, as\namended by chapters 383 of the laws of 2007.\n\n EXISTING LAW :\n\nUnder present law the city of Yonkers mortgage recording tax expires\nAugust 31, 2009.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nIn order for the City of Yonkers to adopt its Fiscal Year 2009-10\nBudget, the Mortgage Recording Tax must be extended since these\nrevenues are included in the City of Yonkers 2009-10 budget.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\n07/26/07 signed chap.383\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :;\n\nThis proposal will preserve $3.3 million in revenue in CFY 2009-10.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nImmediately.\n",
